ich-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids runs 75 years, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 40 of them, more than any other pair. In 2025 on the middle of the grids, June to July came in at 14% of normal and May to June at 46%. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 54% and May to June at 67%. Grid 25876 had its driest year in 1988 at 50% of normal.</p>"}
